{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫59周年台慶前晚順利舉行，今年司儀陣容相當強勁，加上早前被指無綫「雪藏」的麥美恩（Mayanne）強勢歸隊，成為全場焦點所在。</p><p>Mayanne表現同樣出色，不單止未有避忌遭「雪藏」傳聞，更在播放的司儀短片中大方「自抽」，演繹從雪櫃破冰而出</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T11:24:01.983536+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T11:01:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T11:17:17.070359+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T11:17:17.070359+00:00","content_hash":"e2c9691367e850388284f8868a75f44a22b247590dbf12115bf147bfe29c7e5f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}